<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Alumni of GBU have proven themselves to be worthy and competent employees, entrepreneurs, scientists and public servants, which stands as a corroboration to the fact that our nurturing process is one of the finest the nation has to offer. The University is equipped with state of the art laboratories to impart practical knowledge and on-field implementation concomitant with theoretical proficiency.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
